perly awaits db.backup() Promise before accessing the file\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-003\",\n      \"title\": \"Frontend dev server starts and renders\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"cd dashboard && npm run dev starts Vite on port 5173\",\n        \"No React errors in console\",\n        \"Dashboard component renders without crashing\",\n        \"Connection indicator shows status\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 3,\n      \"passes\": true,\n      \"notes\": \"Verified: Vite serves index.html on 5173, Dashboard.tsx has Badge connection indicator\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-004\",\n      \"title\": \"Workflow mode toggle displays and functions\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"WorkflowModeToggle component renders in dashboard header\",\n        \"Shows Simple and Advanced buttons with icons\",\n        \"Clicking Simple sets mode to 'simple'\",\n        \"Clicking Advanced sets mode to 'advanced'\",\n        \".ralph-mode file is updated when mode changes\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 4,\n      \"passes\": true,\n      \"notes\": \"Verified: WorkflowModeToggle in Dashboard.tsx, mode:set handler writes .ralph-mode\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-005\",\n      \"title\": \"TaskList displays correctly for each workflow mode\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"In simple mode: TaskList shows 'User Stories' title with Zap icon\",\n        \"In advanced mode: TaskList shows 'Implementation Plan' title with Rocket icon\",\n        \"Tasks from prd.json display in simple mode\",\n        \"Tasks from IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md display in advanced mode\",\n        \"Completed tasks show green checkmark\"\n      ],\n      \"priority\": 5,\n      \"passes\": false,\n      \"notes\": \"Verify TaskList adapts to workflow mode\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"US-006\",\n      \"title\": \"loop.sh respects workflow mode\",\n      \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\n        \"./loop.sh displays 'Workflow: simple' when .ralph-mode