500 styling\n---\n\n---\n[2026-01-15] Project Initialized","originalFile":"# Progress Log\n\nThis file tracks learnings, patterns, and discoveries across Ralph Wiggum iterations.\nEntries are append-only - never delete, only add.\n\n---\n[2026-01-16] Simple Mode Verification Started\n- Goal: Verify Ralph Wiggum V3 dashboard is complete and functional\n- Mode: Simple (using prd.json for task tracking)\n- Key files: prd.json (tasks), progress.txt (learnings), .ralph-mode (workflow mode)\n- Dashboard location: ./dashboard\n- Build: cd dashboard && npm run build\n- Typecheck: cd dashboard && npx tsc --noEmit\n- Dev server: cd dashboard && npm run dev (port 5173)\n- Backend: cd dashboard && npx tsx server/index.ts (port 3001)\n- Pattern: Check TypeScript compiles BEFORE marking story complete\n- Pattern: Run the actual commands to verify, don't just check file existence\n---\n\n---\n[2026-01-16] US-001 - Dashboard builds without errors\n- What was implemented: Verified dashboard build process\n- Files checked: dashboard package.json, TypeScript config\n- **Learnings:**\n  - npm install shows 7 moderate vulnerabilities but doesn't block builds\n  - tsc --noEmit passes cleanly with no TypeScript errors\n  - Vite build produces ~500KB JS bundle (143KB gzipped)\n---\n\n---\n[2026-01-16] US-002 - Backend server starts and accepts WebSocket connections\n- What was implemented: Fixed async/sync bug in database backup system\n- Files changed: dashboard/server/database/backup.ts, dashboard/server/healthMonitor.ts\n- **Learnings:**\n  - better-sqlite3 db.backup() returns a Promise - must await before accessing the backup file\n  - Server logs \"Ralph Dashboard server started\" with port info (not \"Server running on port\")\n  - HealthMonitor calls DatabaseBackup.performDailyBackupIfNeeded() on startup\n  - Pattern: Don't block startup on async operations - use .catch() for error handling\n---\n\n---\n[2026-01-16] US-003 - Frontend dev server starts and renders\n- What was verified: Vite dev server and Dashboard component\n- Files checked: dashboard/vite.config.ts, dashboard/src/components/Dashboard.tsx\n- **Learnings:**\n  - npm run dev uses concurrently to start both Vite and backend server\n  - Connection indicator is in Dashboard.tsx lines 228-240 using Badge component\n  - Vite 7.3.1 with React refresh working correctly\n---\n\n---\n[2026-01-16] US-004 - Workflow mode toggle displays and functions\n- What was verified: WorkflowModeToggle component and mode persistence\n- Files checked: WorkflowModeToggle.tsx, Dashboard.tsx, useWebSocket.ts, server/index.ts\n- **Learnings:**\n  - WorkflowModeToggle uses Zap icon for Simple, Rocket icon for Advanced\n  - setWorkflowMode sends WebSocket message mode:set which writes to .ralph-mode\n  - mode:set handler also auto-creates missing files (prd.json, progress.txt, or IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md)\n---\n\n---\n[2026-01-15] Project Initialized\n- Pattern: Created complete Ralph Wiggum documentation suite\n- Tip: Start with AUDIENCE_JTBD.md to ground all specs in user needs\n- Tip: Use SLC releases to ship value incrementally\n---\n\n---\n[2026-01-15] Agent Installation Feature Set Complete\n- Pattern: Most features in Releases 1-3 were already implemented, needed systematic verification\n- Pattern: Agent installation follows the established WebSocket message pattern: add type, handler, state, UI\n- Gotcha: The dashboard's npm run typecheck script doesn't exist - use `npx tsc --noEmit` instead\n- Gotcha: Pre-existing lint errors in the codebase (unused vars, case block declarations) - not blockers\n- Tip: YAML frontmatter in agent .md files enables name/description parsing for the UI\n- Tip: No git remote configured - push will need `git remote add origin <url>` first\n---\n\n---\n[2026-01-15] Documentation Sync Complete\n- Pattern: Keep tasks.json in sync with IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md when tasks are completed\n- Pattern: Include all 5 releases (10 Feature Sets) in documentation for completeness\n- Gotcha: tasks.json was outdated (showing 31 pending tasks) while IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md showed 63 complete\n- Tip: Always verify both tracking files match before signaling ALL_TASKS_COMPLETE\n- Tip: Git tags should reflect major milestones (v0.0.4 for Feature Set 10, v0.0.5 for doc sync)\n---\n\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":59,"oldLines":6,"newStart":59,"newLines":16,"lines":[" ---"," "," ---","+[2026-01-16] US-005 - TaskList displays correctly for each workflow mode","+- What was verified: TaskList component and FileWatcher task parsing","+- Files checked: TaskList.tsx, fileWatcher.ts","+- **Learnings:**","+  - TaskList adapts title (User Stories/Implementation Plan) and icon (Zap/Rocket) based on mode","+  - FileWatcher.parseTasks() routes to parsePrdJsonTasks() or parseImplementationPlanTasks()","+  - Completed tasks get CheckCircle2 icon with text-green-500 styling","+---","+","+---"," [2026-01-15] Project Initialized"," - Pattern: Created complete Ralph Wiggum documentation suite"," - Tip: Start with AUDIENCE_JTBD.md to ground all specs in user needs"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
